# Test fixtures and fuzz corpora are byte-exact parser inputs: several are
# binary ciphertext, and the vector parser relies on literal LF (\n) blank-line
# separators. Mark them binary so git never converts line endings on checkout
# (e.g. core.autocrlf=true on the Windows CI runner), which would corrupt them
# and break the fixture-based tests.
tests/testthat/fixtures/** -text
fuzz/seeds/**              -text
*.age                      -text
